OL,3,AJudge denies motion to dismiss Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy's murder case - media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Massachusetts judge has denied
OL,7,Fmotions to dismiss the murder case of
OL,8,FLindsay Clancy, the US woman accused of
OL,9,Fmurdering her three children, according
OL,10,Fto local US media.
OL,12,FThe judge's ruling comes after Clancy's
OL,13,Fdefence team requested dismissal of the
OL,14,Fcase after her first trial ended in a
OL,15,Fmistrial in September, when a 12-person
OL,16,Fjury failed to reach a consensus.
OL,18,FThe ruling clears the way for
OL,19,Fprosecutors to pursue the case. They
OL,20,Fcould reduce the charges in a potential
OL,21,Fsecond trial or dismiss them
OL,22,Faltogether.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
