OL,3,AJudge denies motion to dismiss Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy's murder case - media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FClancy has not denied killing her
OL,7,Fchildren in 2023, but her defence team
OL,8,Fargues she was suffering from severe
OL,9,Fpostpartum psychosis at the time.
OL,10,FProsecutors say the killings were
OL,11,Fintentional.
